<body>
<canvas id="sky"></canvas>
<div class="frame">
  <header>
    <div>No. 001</div>
    <div class="weather" id="weather">clear · drifting</div>
  </header>
  <div class="middle">
    <h1 id="title"><span>A</span> <span>room</span> <span>with</span> <span>weather.</span></h1>
    <p>You have arrived at a page that was waiting for no one. The lights were already on. There is a small climate here, slow as breathing, which you can disturb by moving.</p>
