      <p class="kick">NOTES FROM THE SMALL HOURS</p>
      <h2>What the watch teaches</h2>
      <p class="lead">Marginalia from the long watches. Nothing here is advice; it's only what the hours
      said when they passed.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="notes">
